==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[DL Anniv. Doge Cake|30M DL Anniv. Doge Cake]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~33.33 seconds<sup>60f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
*As with the 20 million stage, it's best to use fast cats such [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] or [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]] to easily rush the stage, as the Cake enemy is [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] and you want to maximize your hits per second as much as possible.
*The Birthday Cake does virtually no damage, making it unnecessary to spawn meatshields.

